WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.670
[Fluorescent hum and muffled footsteps on carpet]

00:00:04.670 --> 00:00:08.500
[Footsteps continue. Something creaks in the distance.]

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:13.500
[Footfalls on tile. Water drips and echoes.]

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:17.500
[Machinery hums. A flashlight clicks and a pipe rings.]

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:22.170
[Heavier footsteps approach. A click, then tape hiss.]

00:00:22.170 --> 00:00:25.167
[The hiss cuts out. A low hum fades.]
